  "info": {
    "description": "\n# Service API for nova_client\n\nThis API is used by BBS clients running nova_client to:\n\n- **Authenticate** using OAuth2 client credentials flow\n- **Upload packets** generated by BRE/FE door games\n- **Download packets** destined for their BBS (poll `/leagues/{league_id}/packets?unread=true`)\n- **Download nodelists** for league member information\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll endpoints except `/auth/token` require OAuth2 Bearer token authentication.\n\n1. Request a token: `POST /service/api/v1/auth/token`, form-encoded, with\n   `grant_type=client_credentials`, `client_id` and `client_secret`.\n   This is the **client credentials** grant - credentials go in the request\n   body, not in a Basic auth header. No scopes are used.\n2. Use the token: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header.\n\nTokens are JWTs and expire after `jwt_expiry_hours` (24 by default).\n\nNote for anyone reading the generated OpenAPI schema: the security scheme is\ndeclared as `OAuth2PasswordBearer` because that is FastAPI's helper for\nextracting a bearer token from the `Authorization` header. It describes how the\ntoken is *presented*, not how it is *obtained* - the token endpoint accepts\n`client_credentials` and nothing else.\n\n## No WebSocket\n\nThere is no WebSocket endpoint. Clients discover work by polling\n`GET /service/api/v1/leagues/{league_id}/packets?unread=true`. Downloading a\npacket is itself the acknowledgement: the hub marks it read when it serves it,\nso it drops out of subsequent `unread=true` responses.\n\n## Packet Naming Convention\n\nPackets follow the format: `<league><game><source><dest>.<seq>`\n\n- **league**: 3-digit league number (e.g., 555)\n- **game**: B (BRE) or F (FE)\n- **source**: 2-digit hex BBS index (01-FF)\n- **dest**: 2-digit hex BBS index (01-FF)\n- **seq**: 3-digit sequence number (000-999, wraps)\n\nExample: `555B0201.001` = BRE League 555, from BBS 02 to BBS 01, sequence 1\n    ",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "title": "Nova Hub - Service API",
    "version": "0.9.0"
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/auth/token": {
      "post": {
        "description": "OAuth2 token endpoint for client authentication\n\n**Grant Type:** client_credentials\n\n**Form Parameters:**\n- `grant_type`: Must be \"client_credentials\"\n- `client_id`: Your client ID\n- `client_secret`: Your client secret\n\nOr send `client_id` and `client_secret` as HTTP Basic credentials\n(RFC 6749 2.3.1) and only `grant_type` in the form. Not both.\n\n**Returns:** An access token, and in `expires_in` how many seconds it lasts\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://hub.example.com/service/api/v1/auth/token\" \\\n  -d \"grant_type=client_credentials\" \\\n  -d \"client_id=your_client_id\" \\\n  -d \"client_secret=your_secret\"\n```",
        "operationId": "login_for_access_token_api_v1_auth_token_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_login_for_access_token_api_v1_auth_token_post"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBasic": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Get Access Token",
        "tags": [
          "Service API - Authentication"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/auth/verify": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Verify your access token and get client information\n\n**Requires:** Valid Bearer token in Authorization header\n\n**Returns:** Client details if token is valid\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"https://hub.example.com/service/api/v1/auth/verify\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN\"\n```",
        "operationId": "verify_token_api_v1_auth_verify_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClientVerifyResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2PasswordBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Verify Access Token",
        "tags": [
          "Service API - Authentication"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/leagues/{league_id}/nodelist": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Download the latest nodelist file for a league\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `league_id`: League identifier with game type (e.g., \"555B\" for BRE, \"555F\" for FE)\n\n**Returns:** Binary nodelist file (BRNODES.xxx or FENODES.xxx)\n\n**Description:**\nThe nodelist contains information about all BBS nodes in the league.\nThese files are generated by the hub and should be placed in your game directory.\n\n**THIS IS NOT THE NORMAL WAY TO GET A NODELIST.** When a league's nodelist\nchanges, the hub's own game sends it on its next run, and the hub queues it\nas an ordinary packet addressed to every member BBS, so it arrives through\nthe same unread-packet flow as game traffic - list packets, download by\nfilename, done. That is deliberate: a nodelist changes once or\ntwice a year, and having every client poll this endpoint every couple of\nminutes to discover that is the wrong shape.\n\nUse this endpoint for **bootstrap and repair only**: a newly registered node\nthat has no nodelist yet and would otherwise sit blind until the next\nregeneration, or one whose game directory was rebuilt. If you are calling it\non a timer, you have almost certainly wired your client up wrong.\n\n**Authentication:** Requires Bearer token and league membership\n\n**Caching:** The response carries `ETag` and `Last-Modified`. Send the ETag\nback as `If-None-Match` (or the date as `If-Modified-Since`) and you get a\n`304 Not Modified` with no body when the nodelist has not changed. Nodelists\nchange rarely but clients poll often, so this is worth doing.\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"https://hub.example.com/service/api/v1/leagues/555B/nodelist\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H 'If-None-Match: \"8f14e45fceea167a5a36dedd4bea2543\"' \\\n  -o BRNODES.555\n```",
        "operationId": "download_nodelist_api_v1_leagues__league_id__nodelist_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "league_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "pattern": "^(\\d{3})([BFIbfi])$",
              "title": "League Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "If-None-Match",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "If-Modified-Since",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/octet-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "format": "binary",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The nodelist"
          },
          "304": {
            "description": "Unchanged since the If-None-Match or If-Modified-Since given"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2PasswordBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Download Nodelist",
        "tags": [
          "Service API - Leagues"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/leagues/{league_id}/packets": {
      "get": {
        "description": "List packets available for download by this client\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `league_id`: League identifier with game type (e.g., \"555B\" for BRE, \"555F\" for FE)\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `unread`: Set to `true` to only show packets not yet downloaded (default: false)\n\n**Returns:** List of packets destined for this client's BBS\n\n**Authentication:** Requires Bearer token",
        "operationId": "list_packets_api_v1_leagues__league_id__packets_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "league_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "pattern": "^(\\d{3})([BFIbfi])$",
              "title": "League Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "description": "Filter to only unread (not downloaded) packets",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "unread",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": false,
              "description": "Filter to only unread (not downloaded) packets",
              "title": "Unread",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PacketListResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2PasswordBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "List Available Packets",
        "tags": [
          "Service API - Packets"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/leagues/{league_id}/packets/{filename}": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Download a specific packet file\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `league_id`: League identifier with game type (e.g., \"555B\" for BRE, \"555F\" for FE)\n- `filename`: Packet filename (e.g., \"555B0102.001\")\n\n**Returns:** Binary packet file\n\n**Authentication:** Requires Bearer token and authorization for destination BBS",
        "operationId": "download_packet_api_v1_leagues__league_id__packets__filename__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "league_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "pattern": "^(\\d{3})([BFIbfi])$",
              "title": "League Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "filename",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Filename",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/octet-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "format": "binary",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The packet"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2PasswordBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Download Packet",
        "tags": [
          "Service API - Packets"
        ]
      },
      "put": {
        "description": "Upload a game packet to the hub using PUT with raw body\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `league_id`: League identifier with game type (e.g., \"555B\" for BRE, \"555F\" for FE)\n- `filename`: Packet filename (e.g., \"555B0201.001\")\n\n**Request Body:** Raw file data (application/octet-stream)\n\n**Packet Filename Format, BRE and FE:** `<league><game><source><dest>.<seq>`\n- League: 3 digits (e.g., 555)\n- Game: B (BRE) or F (FE)\n- Source: 2-digit hex BBS index (e.g., 02)\n- Dest: 2-digit hex BBS index (e.g., 01)\n- Seq: 3-digit sequence (000-999)\n\n**Packet Filename Format, Immortal Barons:** `L<league>-<source>-<seq>-<dest>.brp`\n- League: 3 digits (e.g., 555), in a league with game I (555I)\n- Source, Dest: BBS index in base 36 (e.g., 2, 1z); dest 0 is every board\n- Seq: 13-digit zero-padded base-36 sequence\n\n**Example:** `555B0201.001` = BRE League 555, from BBS 02 to BBS 01, seq 1\n\n**Authentication:** Requires Bearer token",
        "operationId": "upload_packet_api_v1_leagues__league_id__packets__filename__put",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "league_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "pattern": "^(\\d{3})([BFIbfi])$",
              "title": "League Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "filename",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Filename",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/octet-stream": {
              "schema": {
                "format": "binary",
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PacketUploadResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "OAuth2PasswordBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Upload Packet",
        "tags": [
          "Service API - Packets"
        ]
      }
    },
